N/A ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Red Snow Dagger''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing in the Top 100 on the gifting leaderboard {{Currency|Gift}} during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Snow Dagger]], but it's color scheme has been altered to red colors.

== Trivia ==

* It has [[Gold Snow Dagger|gold]], [[Bronze Snow Dagger|bronze]] and [[Silver Snow Dagger|silver]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

